{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"After review: the root is passed as str (config.repo_root() returns a Path; gate_runs takes str); the ff4a test's record_gate_run stub now accepts the repo_root keyword, otherwise it would raise in the daemon. Scope note: the gate BODY's own stores (sidecar, journal) are resolved by the gate work itself, which already receives its ticket/root from the request; this fix covers the gate-run index writes that leaked. Related suites: 65 passed; no .rebar/gate_runs left in the worktree."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795278320527299001,"uuid":"6a104e5d-0c68-497c-b95c-f7ec49156dcf"}